  "severity": "Important",
  "description": "OCI Hook to generate seccomp json files based on EBF syscalls used by container oci-seccomp-bpf-hook provides a library for applications looking to use the Container Pod concept popularized by Kubernetes.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* net/http: golang: Go net/http: Unencrypted HTTP/2 connections vulnerable to Denial of Service (CVE-2026-56853)\n\n* net/http: golang: golang: Denial of Service via crafted HTTP Range headers (CVE-2026-78667)\n\n* crypto/x509: golang: crypto/x509: Man-in-the-middle attacks via untrusted intermediate certificates (CVE-2026-111943)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
